Package: nmreview
Type: Package
Title: Local Review and Compact Storage of NONMEM Results
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: person("NM Review", "Contributors", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "nmreview@example.org")
Description: A local Shiny application for comparing completed NONMEM runs,
    inspecting linked observations, and preserving compact PsN bootstrap and
    prediction-corrected visual predictive check results in a portable archive.
    Includes a reproducible synthetic example that works without NONMEM.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
Imports: shiny, bslib, DT, ggplot2, DBI, RSQLite, jsonlite, digest, stats, utils, grDevices, tools
Suggests: tcltk
NeedsCompilation: no
